4078592", "created_at": "2026-11-03T16:30:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117655544244912611"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/KUe7nLYZ0Q", "end": 302, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/startup__pedia/status/2117655544244912611/video/1", "media_key": "13_2117601386271768576", "start": 279, "url": "https://t.co/KUe7nLYZ0Q"}]}, "id": "2117655544244912611", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 16, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "A Roorkee-based energy storage startup, IndiEnergy, is developing sodium-ion batteries and hard-carbon anode materials using agricultural waste.\n\nThe startup converts agricultural biomass, including rice straw and sugarcane bagasse, into BioBlack, a hard-carbon material used as https://t.co/KUe7nLYZ0Q", "url": "https://x.com/startup__pedia/status/2117655544244912611"}, {"author_id": "1719900898904993792", "created_at": "2026-11-02T05:39:27.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117129440333562244"], "id": "2117129440333562244", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 79, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "When I started working with my client, the company had approximately 180 MWh of battery storage projects in its development pipeline.\n\nThey had identified suitable sites, secured initial land agreements, and were advancing grid interconnection applications.\n\nBut despite the", "url": "https://x.com/ghostwriterbeau/status/2117129440333562244"}, {"author_id": "1611906439521484801", "created_at": "2026-11-03T14:42:05.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117628384234615142"], "id": "2117628384234615142", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 16, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Gartner: data center power up 26% this year. Grid interconnection runs 4+ years. You can't build AI infrastructure on that timeline. Off-grid dedicated power is what actually moves. What's the path for AI campus development this decade?", "url": "https://x.com/grantbmcdaniel/status/2117628384234615142"}, {"author_id": "1280738015300579328", "created_at": "2026-11-03T14:10:56.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117620548587192714"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 237, "start": 225, "tag": "DataCenters"}], "mentions": [{"end": 224, "id": "817386", "start": 215, "username": "Techmeme"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/Techmeme/statu…", "end": 261, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/Techmeme/status/2117590315796451736", "start": 238, "url": "https://t.co/7LkcaYtKVw"}]}, "id": "2117620548587192714", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 27, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117590315796451736", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Data center developers are repurposing retired jet engines as aeroderivative natural gas turbines, cutting power deployment timelines to ~2 years and bypassing 5-to-10-year utility grid interconnection queues.\n\nvia @Techmeme #DataCenters\nhttps://t.co/7LkcaYtKVw", "url": "https://x.com/VisiveAI/status/2117620548587192714"}, {"author_id": "1692743144142725120", "created_at": "2026-11-02T12:57:06.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117239579271192963"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/14NVWp6TOI", "end": 73, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/Jason_EPOTN/status/2117239579271192963/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2117239525126860800", "start": 50, "url": "https://t.co/14NVWp6TOI"}]}, "id": "2117239579271192963", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 8, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Hard Carbon Anode Material for Sodium ion Battery https://t.co/14NVWp6TOI", "url": "https://x.com/Jason_EPOTN/status/2117239579271192963"}, {"author_id": "1692743144142725120", "created_at": "2026-11-02T12:57:18.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_i